hir/R4/datatypes.html#CodeableConcept#CodeableConcept.text\">CodeableConcept.text</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td>Le texte original CDA alimente directement CodeableConcept.text.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-CE.html#CE.code\">CE.code</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">CodeableConcept.coding.code</td><td>Le code principal CDA CE alimente coding.code.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-CE.html#CE.codeSystem\">CE.codeSystem</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">CodeableConcept.coding.system</td><td>Le codeSystem CDA est transformé en URI de type urn:oid:[codeSystem] pour alimenter coding.system.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-CE.html#CE.displayName\">CE.displayName</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td colspan=\"3\">CodeableConcept.coding.display</td><td>Le libellé CDA displayName alimente coding.display.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-CE.html#CE.translation\">CE.translation</a></td><td>0..*</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#CodeableConcept#CodeableConcept.coding\">CodeableConcept.coding</a></td><td>0..*</td><td>todo</td><td>Chaque translation CDA crée un coding supplémentaire dans le CodeableConcept cible.</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 3 </b>Mapping from <